    "sections": {
        "description": "Real Estate Company is a clean, modern and feature-rich WordPress theme built specifically for real estate agencies, property developers, and real estate professionals. Whether you're showcasing houses for sale, apartments for rent, commercial properties, or property listings — this theme provides all the tools you need to build a professional property listing website quickly and easily. The theme comes with a fully responsive and retina-ready design, ensuring that your property images and layouts look great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It supports powerful listing features such as property galleries, detailed property descriptions, price and location display, property categories (e.g. sale, rent, commercial, residential), search and filter options, and contact forms for inquiries — helping your clients find the right property and contact you easily. With built-in support for popular plugins like WooCommerce (for property payments or bookings), Elementor (for easy drag-and-drop customization), and SEO-friendly markup, Real Estate Company is optimized for performance and search engine visibility. The clean, well-structured code also ensures compatibility with caching and performance plugins for fast loading speed. Whether you are a small real estate agency, an individual realtor, or a large property firm — Real Estate Company is designed to give you a modern, functional and easy-to-manage website that impresses your clients and drives conversions. Discover all features and live demos at https://www.templatehouse.net/themes/real-estate-construction-group-wordpress-theme/"
    },
